      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "村口，一位老武師攔住了你：「要上塔？先挑一把趁手的兵器。拿我的練習史萊姆試試，不合手就換。」",
        "en": "At the edge of the village an old weapon master stops you: \"Climbing the tower? Pick a weapon that fits your hand first. Try them on my training slime, and change if one does not suit you.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "聽聽各種兵器。",
            "en": "Tell me about them."
          },
          "next": "weapons"
        },
