    "weapons": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "「弓：拉得越久越有力，標記會折返，射偏了還能補救。劍：一揮到底，不回頭，失手要收劍。法杖：要聚氣，慢，但滿氣時最重。」",
        "en": "\"The bow: the longer the draw, the harder the shot, and the marker turns back, so a miss can be saved. The sword: one sweep, no turning back, and a miss means putting it back first. The staff: it needs focus and is slow, but a full charge hits hardest.\""
      },
